title: "Hexagonal Population Surfaces for Canada (H3 Resolutions 6, 7 and 8)"
type: dataset
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-12-01"   # TODO: set on release
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX"  # TODO: Zenodo concept DOI after first release
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/unitepangaea/canada-h3-population"
url: "https://carleton.ca/determinants/"
abstract: >-
  National population count and density surfaces for Canada on the H3 hexagonal
  grid at resolutions 6, 7 and 8, produced by disaggregating 2021 Census
  Dissemination Block population with a hybrid dasymetric method that combines
  National Address Register locations and ISED Pseudo-Household points.
keywords:
  - dasymetric mapping
  - H3 hexagons
  - population density
  - Canada
  - Census geography
  - address-point allocation
